# Manual / exploration test-data (software/test-data/manual/): track only the reproducible
# recipe — generators (*.py), docs (*.md), and any non-regenerable harvested input
# (whitelist_cells.txt). All generated data is ignored; regenerate with each dir's generator
# (see its README). Automated-test fixtures under software/test-data/fixtures/ (and test/assets/)
# stay fully tracked, so they are intentionally not listed here.
software/test-data/manual/**
!software/test-data/manual/**/
!software/test-data/manual/**/*.py
!software/test-data/manual/**/*.md
!software/test-data/manual/antigen/whitelist_cells.txt

